1:["$","$Le",null,{"record":{"slug":"milan-food","section":"practice","title":["以食为天：米兰三年展","Food Ecology at the Milan Triennale"],"date":"2025","status":["展览","Exhibition"],"summary":["从屏南田野到米兰展场，以食物链为线索呈现生态、生产与生活之间的联系。","From Pingnan fieldwork to Milan, an exhibition follows food to connect ecology, production and everyday life."],"image":"/assets/editorial/milan.jpg","caption":["“以食为天”展示图解与装置效果图，汇报 PDF 第8页；非现场照片。","Diagram and installation rendering, presentation p.8; not an installation photograph."],"topic":true,"chapters":[{"title":["地方经验的视觉转化","Giving local experience a visual form"],"text":["参展内容来自大食物馆在地实践，通过同心圆图解、人物肖像、药膳与影像等材料，呈现食物、环境和劳动者的关系。","The exhibition draws on the pavilion’s field practice through concentric diagrams, portraits, medicinal cuisine and moving images."]},{"title":["展览与资料版本","Exhibition and versions"],"text":["2025年5月6日文章预告第24届米兰三年展将于5月12日开幕，后续获奖报道确认团队参加过该展。不同资料的图解层数与名称存在差异，图版按原版本保留。","The 6 May article previewed a 12 May opening; the later award report confirms participation. Diagram descriptions vary between sources and are retained as distinct versions."]}],"related":["food-media","diverse-foods","food-ecology","conference-2025"],"sources":["milan","award","overview"],"credits":["联合策展人：姜珺；参展导师：姜珺、顾文佳、蔡文超、郭星、姚之洁。图解、视频、平面、展陈与翻译团队完整署名见原文。","Co-curator: Jiang Jun. Faculty: Jiang Jun, Gu Wenjia, Cai Wenchao, Guo Xing and Yao Zhijie. Complete diagram, film, graphic, exhibition and translation credits appear in the source."]}}]
